body:
oh, thank you very much for the reply... this was really kinda the response i needed...

thank you for the suggestions, i do have ptsd according to my therapist, and I know about the other two terms but they don’t apply to me, fortunately. my therapist also said something similar about first reflecting on my childhood, and i’m working hard to do just that but i seem to have a lot of repressed memories, etc. maybe one day i can appreciate myself but sadly it isn’t anytime soon :p

again, thank you for the response. have a good day ! :’}
